### endpoint para las piezas

### crear una pieza 
POST http://localhost:8080/piece HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "idPiece": 1,
    "name": "B01",
    "theoristWeight": 4.0,
    "realWeight": 4.5,
    "state": "PENDIENTE"
}

###listar todas las piezas
GET http://localhost:8080/piece HTTP/1.1

### obtener una pieza por su id
GET http://localhost:8080/piece/001 HTTP/1.1

### actualizar una pieza
PUT http://localhost:8080/piece/001 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "B01",
    "theoristWeight": 0,
    "realWeight": 0,
    "state": "FABRICADO"
}

### borrar una pieza
DELETE http://localhost:8080/piece/001 HTTP/1.1
